```
{{if ne .RootDirDisplay "."}}cd {{.RootDirDisplay}} && {{end}}go mod tidy   # needs network access to resolve github.com/herlenashavi/go-api
```
{{else}}The monorepo root already depends on `github.com/herlenashavi/go-api` —
nothing to resolve before running this service.
{{end}}{{else}}```
